  (text "AD5754BREZ Minimal DAC Breakout" (at 30 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) bold) (justify left)))
  (text "Quad 16-bit DAC - Bipolar +/-5V mode\nTSSOP-24 package, SPI interface\nAD5754BREZ (non-R, no internal ref)\nDesigned for JLCPCB PCBA assembly" (at 30 35 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)))
  (text "Power:\n  AVDD = +12V (Eurorack)\n  AVSS = -12V (Eurorack)\n  DVCC = +3.3V (Teensy)\n  All GND/DAC_GND/SIG_GND to unified ground plane\n  Exposed paddle = AVSS (thermal)" (at 30 120 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)))
  (text "SPI (Teensy 4.1):\n  SCLK  -> Pin 13 (SCK)\n  SDIN  -> Pin 11 (MOSI)\n  SDO   -> Pin 12 (MISO)\n  SYNC  -> Pin 10 (CS)\n  SPI Mode 1 (CPOL=0, CPHA=1)" (at 30 135 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)))
  (text "Control pins:\n  LDAC -> GND (immediate update)\n  CLR  -> DVCC via 10k (no accidental clear)\n  BIN/2sCOMP -> GND (twos complement coding)\n  NC pins 2,6,12,13: leave unconnected" (at 100 120 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)))
  (text "Outputs:\n  VOUTA-D -> 100R series -> header\n  (short-circuit protection)\n  +/-5V bipolar range (software config)\n  0x0000=-5V, 0x8000=0V, 0xFFFF=+5V" (at 100 135 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)))
  (text "ADR421 Reference (MANDATORY):\n  AD5754BREZ has NO internal reference\n  ADR421 provides 2.5V ultra-precision (3 ppm/C)\n  VOUT -> REFIN pin 17\n  Cannot omit U2 on this chip variant!" (at 100 150 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left)))
  (text "NOTE: This is the AD5754BREZ (TSSOP-24)\nNOT the AD5754R (SSOP-28). Pinout is\ndifferent! See datasheet Table 5.\nNo RSET, no DCEN, no BIN/OFF pin." (at 30 155 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016) bold) (justify left)))
  (title_block
    (title "MusicBrain - AD5754BREZ Minimal DAC Breakout Board")
    (date "2026-06-07")
    (rev "1.1")
    (company "MusicBrain project")
    (comment 1 "Quad 16-bit DAC, bipolar +/-5V, TSSOP-24, SPI interface")
    (comment 2 "AD5754BREZ (non-R) requires ADR421 external 2.5V reference")
    (comment 3 "Designed for JLCPCB PCBA assembly - 0805 passives, TSSOP-24 DAC")
    (comment 4 "Pinout from datasheet Table 5 - 4 NC pins, no RSET/DCEN")
  )
)